## Composition with other classes

- **`:mm/Memory`** — memorials reference tags via `:mm.memory/tags` (free-text mix) or `:mm.memory/themes` (controlled-vocabulary canonical refs)
- **`:mm/ConceptScheme`** — tags can be members of named vocabulary schemes (`:mm.tag/in-scheme`)
- **`:mm/Shape`** — validation shapes for SHACL-style tag-shape checks

